          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:65b057d2abef02333e41d9e898329dd2cedbb2bc68f21ff5a8196875980171c7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/vouching.py#L34-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:744482235b71ed9dc88bb0ff66bb2b71dfcbf5e3111043a58056c1ec49a6deb8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/vouching.py#L65-L70",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4f5d9c00f17bdd20c608989d5246563f2c8a9f9803061ab078de750d2d09dadf:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4f64671e91f04bfa8d96da236be73467",
      "statement": "A granted vouch is persisted with a server-generated vc_ + 32-hex id, an optional note stored but never exposed on any read edge, the weight column forced to 1, and server-authoritative created_at/created_epoch taken from the injected clock at insert time — the client-signed created_at participates only in validation and the expiry-window cap; success returns 201 {vouch_id, status: active, voucher, vouchee, scope, expires_at}.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/store.py#L701-L717",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2a6831e328d87d491a86fbde971bb6a17030af40d88f232478f3fd8012cebf56:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/vouching.py#L72-L90",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4fcdfc0290158d2360ec5dd1d60cb1f87c6bc1fc4961641fb438914460d7c324:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b5ad23e3ef0f43428c1d495150c51529",
      "statement": "Store.create_vouch enforces the outgoing cap (VOUCH_LIMIT_REACHED, 429, when the voucher already holds vouch_max_outgoing active — unrevoked and unexpired — outgoing vouches, default 10) and the duplicate-scope rule (VOUCH_EXISTS, 409, for an identical active voucher+vouchee+scope edge) inside the same BEGIN IMMEDIATE transaction as the insert and the audit entry vouch.created (actor agent:voucher), making the scarcity checks race-free and atomic with the record.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/config.py#L52-L52",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fffbd2d5c70700592ba3949c5678489fe5dbcca3d0ec1df2ab6d13f0b3f4c10c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/store.py#L686-L723",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ce33eeff3d8baa6e4a4733440da219127872d77ee7930471a70cc9d8a4f35275:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9568ed597bd84e0599fe8c1bb6f512f7",
      "statement": "Revocation (DELETE /v1/vouches/{vouch_id}) requires the body {voucher_fingerprint, revoked_at, signature} signed by the registered key of the original voucher over exactly those two fields; the voucher's agent row must exist but need not be live; Store.revoke_vouch refuses unknown or already-revoked ids with VOUCH_NOT_FOUND and non-owner revocation with SIGNATURE_MISMATCH, sets revoked_at to the server time (client revoked_at is signed content only), appends the audit entry vouch.revoked in the same transaction, and revocation is immediate and permanent with no un-revoke path (expired vouches remain revocable).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/store.py#L725-L743",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9c1c17b30a593731cb19787cfd10e9c2361e7244a937a7ec870cc5e7c77bd604:"
        },
        {
