    {
      "id": "claim_4d94d93bd8314811a9518275e45b4c43",
      "statement": "voucher_tenure_hours is the raw number of hours the voucher's listing had existed when the vouch was created (max(0, (created_epoch - registered_epoch)/3600) against the voucher's agent row, or null if the row is gone), computed per edge at read time; the directory never thresholds it — the vouch_young_hours = 72 config knob documents the SPEC youth window but no code consumes it, so ignoring vouches from young vouchers is a consumer policy reading the label.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/config.py#L51-L54",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7eb97847da078dabdd60549c1294dd037dadb3d49f89475779984652fb94f8a1:"
