    {
      "id": "claim_12a39e707861490ca4a986ab5a58605a",
      "statement": "Vouching rejections use the stable add-only error-code table: VOUCHER_NOT_LISTED (400), VOUCHEE_NOT_LISTED (404), VOUCH_INVALID (400), VOUCH_EXPIRED (400), VOUCH_EXISTS (409), VOUCH_NOT_FOUND (404), VOUCH_LIMIT_REACHED (429), SIGNATURE_MISMATCH (400) — delivered in the shared {error: {code, message, request_id}} envelope with 201 on grant and 200 on revocation and all graph/path reads.",
      "evidence": [
