    {
      "id": "claim_6405022746c24c21a6e4e187848d882f",
      "statement": "tests/test_vouching.py asserts the end-to-end contract over real HTTP with an injected clock: 201 grant visible in both the inbound graph and the profile trust block; signed DELETE revocation removes the edge from active inbound reads; unregistered vouchee VOUCHEE_NOT_LISTED (404); past expiry VOUCH_EXPIRED and over-long expiry VOUCH_INVALID (400); duplicate active scope VOUCH_EXISTS (409); the vouch_max_outgoing cap returning VOUCH_LIMIT_REACHED (429); and /v1/trust/paths finding the depth-2 chain A to B to C with max_depth=2 while returning an empty path list for the unreachable reverse direction.",
      "evidence": [
